> Is one dose a week enough--or too much? Are there any side effects or
> interactions with other drugs, such as the neurotransmitter-suppresser
> ST:TNG and related dopamines?
> 

None that I know of (besides it's interaction with choline [and DMAE and
lecithin] to produce acetylcholine)

